      "author_handle": "micfitz",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "I am newly pregnant and still breast feeding my 15 month old son. I have had people tell me we should stop. We only do it once or twice a day. Usually when I get home from work, then before he goes to sleep at night. My concern is the health risk to the unborn babies. Yes, I am pregnant with twins! Has any one heared either way from a Doctor?",
